[{"title":"金人击鞠图","author":"傅若金","text":"骏马如云击鞠驰，衣冠彷佛正隆时。\n向来北地誇豪俊，不省中原厌乱离。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27425,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"傅若金","text":"渔家日暮乱收罾，欲及前舟苦未能。\n行尽绿杨二十里，隔河遥见驿亭灯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27426,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无题四首 其一","author":"傅若金","text":"天台灵草满溪香，缥缈鸾笙隔洞房。\n谁见桃源花树里，春来日日待刘郎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27427,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无题四首 其二","author":"傅若金","text":"江头芳树碧重重，中有危楼对楚峰。\n尽日娉婷倚窗下，看花不使外人逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27428,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无题四首 其三","author":"傅若金","text":"楼上仙衣捲薄罗，楼前春暖杏花多。\n凤箫最好吹明月，惟有萧郎自教他。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27429,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无题四首 其四","author":"傅若金","text":"江草离离江水流，玉人何处卷帘钩。\n垂杨学尽春来瘦，不省人间有别愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27430,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"潞县舟中寄京师杨上舍诸公四首 其一","author":"傅若金","text":"买得吴船系柳根，潞河新雨过黄昏。\n都门只隔烟中树，一夜